!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
In its own file
description: a container as a whole document of its language
- |
  A container may be a whole file — `file/yamlover`, `file/json5p`, `file/yaml`, … — and
  its interior nodes then speak that file's language without the `file/` prefix, locked
  by the [language rule](::language:concretes:inheritance): the interior of a `.json5p`
  cannot switch to yaml. A file and a subdirectory are equivalent representations of the
  same node.
